WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.200
The reader already pays for a chatbot.

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:09.000
So hand it the thing it cannot assemble.

3
00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:12.000
Rendered once, on the server.

4
00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:15.100
And no quote is edited to fit.

5
00:00:15.100 --> 00:00:18.400
The bound says what it left out.

6
00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:22.100
Then running it found the real defect.

7
00:00:22.100 --> 00:00:25.300
A field nothing had ever drawn.

8
00:00:25.300 --> 00:00:29.200
And a browser that refused the clipboard.

9
00:00:29.200 --> 00:00:32.100
The evidence file, on the clipboard.
